# threshold.config — baseline tuning for CIC-IDS2017 Monday benign traffic
# Each suppress carries a reason: why this is normal for this capture.
# We do not edit suricata.rules — all tuning lives here.
# Run03 baseline: 1,887,228 alerts across 76 signatures on 11.7M benign packets.

# =============================================================================
# CATEGORY 1: Capture artifacts — not real network issues
# =============================================================================

# TCPv4 invalid checksum — NIC checksum offloading, pcap captured pre-checksum (1,860,625)
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2200074

# UDPv6 invalid checksum — same cause as above (86)
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2200078

# Ethertype unknown — non-standard ethernet frames in the 2017 capture (7,454)
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2200121

# IPv4 fragmentation overlap — reassembly edge case from capture (5)
suppress gen_id 1, sig_id 2200070

